  "name": "Two with One Blow (Asterisk Talent)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Archer 4</p><p>An archer with this talent can use a bow or crossbow to attack two opponents adjacent to each other at once by taking a -4 penalty on the attack roll. The attack may hit either, both, or neither opponent depending on the roll and the Armor Class of each opponent. Damage for each opponent is resolved separately. If the attack roll results in the threat of a critical hit, roll to confirm each critical hit separately. This talent can be used on any bow or crossbow attack, including a full attack action.</p><p><em>Asterisk talent: cannot be combined with other asterisked talents; usable once per round.</em></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
